  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1) Strengthening Governance of Alternative financial institutions.

2) Mitigating Risk of Foreign Currency (FX) exposure.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Alternative financial institutions.</narrative>
