  <description type="4">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GRANT NUMBER: FSDAFRICA/FSDAI/056/2021</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support of FSDAi Debt Investment into segregated Investment Vehicle I and Lendable Fintech Credit Fund.

Activities and Outputs:
1) Identify the framework(s) stipulating performance standards in responsible lending and consumer protection.

2) Working with Alternative financial institutions in SSA to ensure that the standards in said framework are implemented.

3) Procure resources to educate customers on hedge implementation and management; identify potential strategies in complex markets and access data and tools to enable the development of those strategies.

4) Cover setup up and ongoing costs of hedging providers.

5) Cover legal costs associated with hedging instruments.</narrative>
  </description>
